It's quite rare for me to receive
guests, but my, you certainly are filthy.

117
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,012
Was it a stressful trip?

118
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:42,397
Well, yes, but it's sort
of a long story. We, uh...

119
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,310
Go ahead, Nami.

120
00:05:43,393 --> 00:05:45,517
