doctor stuff later.

121
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,797
We were attacked by a bunch
of zombies in the forest?

122
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:50,527
So we ran away and came
here to take shelter.

123
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,350
Zombies, huh?

124
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,917
We also saw a bunch of crazy
monsters that were straight out

125
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,337
of a horror story What the heck
is up with this creepy island?

126
00:05:58,420 --> 00:05:59,737
I mean, you live here, right?

127
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:03,117
You gotta know something So these
beasts were chasing you, were they?

128
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:05,217
And yet you still made
it here in one piece.

129
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:06,557
Quite impressive!

130
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,577
But to answer your question.

131
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:10,937
