those creatures either.

132
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:12,997
Which is precisely why I'm here?

133
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:15,256
Oh, you mean you're studying zombies?

134
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:17,817
It's a brand new realm of medical research

135
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,737
Yes, indeed.

136
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:21,740
Although most people
associate zombies with fear,

137
