on this island without interruption.

147
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,760
Oh, wow.

148
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,737
So I finally found out the truth.

149
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:52,197
But just think, if your
research here is a success,

150
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:55,857
