thousands of people all over the world.

151
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:59,320
As a doctor myself, sir,
I'm behind you all the way.

152
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,700
How open-minded.

153
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,180
Why, thank you, Dr. Chopper.

154
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,654
