seen a skeleton roaming around today?

176
00:08:12,180 --> 00:08:13,060
A skeleton?

177
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:17,579
Yeah, he had an afro and he was in
a really good mood for a dead guy.

178
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,270
Course,

179
00:08:22,353 --> 00:08:23,417
even for this place,

180
