skeleton walking around and talking.

181
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,581
So you're sure he didn't come by?

182
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,320
Never seen him.

183
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,661
All right, then.

184
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,200
It's no big deal.

185
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,800
