186
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:42,240
No, it couldn't be.

187
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,837
I know I shouldn't, but
I want to take a peek.

188
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:49,940
What? You do?

189
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,555
Chopper, I'm shocked.

190
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:54,477
I'm not talking about Nami's
butt, you silly human.

191
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,897
The thing I want to take a peek at is Dr.

192
