196
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:05,497
You know, Nami, if you're that afraid
to take a shower by your lonesome,

197
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:07,477
Maybe you should skip it all together.

198
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:11,537
Maybe some of us don't want to smell
like zombies any longer than we have to.

199
00:09:11,620 --> 00:09:12,450
Stinky butts.

200
