As soon as nighttime
hits, we're out of here.

204
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:18,510
What?

205
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:19,510
At night?

206
00:09:19,593 --> 00:09:21,676
But it's scary enough during the day!

207
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:28,397
We finally found a place where
nobody's trying to eat us,

208
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,057
but as soon as we step outside,

209
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:32,217
we're the main course
in a Straw Hat buffet!

210
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:35,697
That sounds painful, so for the time
being, I'm staying right where I am,

211
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:37,937
all we gotta do is wait
for Luffy to show up.

212
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:38,917
He'll save us.

213
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:39,997
I think He's right, mommy.

214
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,097
This island's way too creepy for us.

215
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:44,597
