222
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:01,997
I need my brains.

223
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,040
The one I'm worried about is Dr.

224
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:09,157
Hogback himself he's lying to us there's
no doubt about it if he really has Nothing

225
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,377
to do with the zombies on this island then

226
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,357
you tell me why they
leave his place alone?

227
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,037
And terrorize everything else.

228
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:19,397
Hey, what do you think
we should do, Chopper?

229
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,757
If what she's saying.

230
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:23,900
is true no way is she saying that Dr.

231
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:27,877
Hogback is working with the zombies that's
why we're gonna make our escape while

232
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:32,548
we still have the chance when I'm finished
here we make a break For the coast.

233
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,660
You are a very observant woman.

234
00:10:38,380 --> 00:10:39,210
What?

235
00:10:39,293 --> 00:10:41,141
